+
+Net change, specific: T10 and T12 (S2); T09 -> n/d (ND); T02 by scorer (N1).
+Pair tier, specific: `UNKNOWN | UNKNOWN` becomes n/d with T09, so under a1
+`slots_specific` is scored out of 6 determined pairs (v2: 7).
+`GAP_INSTRUMENT_CRASH | CRASHED` stays n/d under `specific` (T08).
+
+Direction check, stated plainly. Of the changes, T12's `reason`, N1 and the
+`missing_path` part of T10 move toward the Claude readings; T09 moves to
