+T12 (12 names it gave: 5 + 1 + 2 + 2 + 2). R-b was chosen over the alternative
+that opens the `proposal` record, which `amendment_options/` shows would raise
+Claude-v2-A's specific pair agreement from 3 of 6 to 4 of 6; R-a keeps T14 as
+key v2 had it. That is weak evidence that the rules were not fitted to the
+reader: one drafter, one family. A reader from another family is the real test.
+
+Owner's note (2026-11-18), as given for the patch as received: T10's change
+reaches the same conclusion as the erratum on the pair tier
+(`GAP_INSTRUMENT_CRASH | CRASHED` is not MAPS), from the code by a different
